..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : EKLAB.KBUAUTO.BN
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Kompletteaktualisierung der Lieferabrufe
.. Functionality  : automatic full update of forecasts
...Includes       :
..  include     ek/EKLAB.BSTART.BV
..  include     ek/EKLAB.KBUSTORNO.BN
..  include     ek/EKLAB.KBUDISPO.BN
..  include     ek/EKLAB.KBUVORSCHLAG.BN
..  include     ek/EKLAB.KBUKONVERT.BN
..  include     ek/EKLAB.KBUKEINBEDARF.BN
..*****************************************************************************
..<META M|='ek/EKLAB'>
.set trans -
..
.. force required settings
.formula M|kbmark = G|true
.formula M|kbliefzeigen = G|false
.formula M|kbrahmenzeigen = G|false
.formula M|kballeszeigen = G|true
..
..
.. load old scheduled forecasts into table
.input "EKLAB.BSTART.BV"
..
.. cancel old forecasts
.input "EKLAB.KBUSTORNO.BN"
..
.. get new schedule
.input "EKLAB.KBUDISPO.BN"
..
.. optimize schedule
.input "EKLAB.KBUVORSCHLAG.BN"
..
.. convert pruchase order suggestion to forecast
.input "EKLAB.KBUKONVERT.BN"
..
.. add no-demand forecasts
.input "EKLAB.KBUKEINBEDARF.BN"
..
..*****************************************************************************
.. !END
.continue
